<font style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 13px">Consent
of Marcum, LLP, Independent Registered Public Accounting
Firm&#x2756;</font></div>
</td>
</tr><tr>
<td style="vertical-align: top; width: 9%">
<div style="text-align: left; margin-left: 24px; margin-right: 0px; text-indent: -24px">
<font style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 13px">&#xA0;</font></div>
</td>
<td style="vertical-align: bottom; width: 2%">
<div><font style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 13px">&#xA0;</font></div>
</td>
<td style="vertical-align: top; width: 89%">
<div style="text-align: justify; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; text-indent: 0px">
<font style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 13px">&#xA0;</font></div>
